        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v4SEgtLofXpf3V48nPJhCWee79SZF3OWFAtZUXP0xd4web0y-5So3Z5efLGSay14sPCWX5vFR_8h5S_VAC-UetilJIH_4jdiXpPLooM-cRrSZRQkpFQGK_FTzMm7TQZ4K7vdTrO7sZsN7-bql0Lh-Ieuvjw0yJw4e4t1eYYLlkpqGi74oAfL0ZZ7DfJCo7MXx4K6QO25zXSfFGjsFbkCftOkBktC0-ng33lKuVvINqf4MWJv3gZNrVrX_6LnCw8A9OlCY82OXIxqVH9v8t6uzOoKbNXNSiTZ1g_Al37zAL309aFurOvzuWVHGn7lzBAmqOLh0YrlEDpXmD6_7J50PAPXB-Uk5sMGcEhJbOfAZzSWYtwJUHMNfbZIyMpTYivSCXDIPDotjvzx4ypQD_YpYrva6j_GLLcpoMmft9Gua6B6JDytXLxKl0HAkB224PSVh5N9t358SYwvkyk7Gqzy-yIEVh-J5BoXTUTzeh50Pr-qaoUU4fNv7GJXV01S9xWeDV5356nChjBVCPtJZag4YJaTGlTbT3Pz3NrHHmS-AjjLVVdgBXdok3SlcAB9pIkCchdK3n8MUPENta1RQoYoV7cDkwzIy9-bGIRu0sbBbliwuSoWuFQE1XFC5WILiPyRHL0y1gdzoDTuWy5hCQzhJbhID2hDqLuYZ_YOJ9-7JEg13GEoctDIde8riXzpCe0P3WuAZDBNkDezT2t3GbUSUjRnYtqLw" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>「入間川の水運」収録。<br>「明治十七年一月建、出丸中郷祭主 加藤<br>幸三郎」銘。<br><br>水神宮　入間川（左岸）<br>　　比企郡川島町出丸中郷<br>　　円福寺から北へ200mの民家の入り口<br>　　明治十七年（1884）一月<br>　　祭主　出丸中郷　加藤某]]></description>
